headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  # Flix Backend API Collection

  This Bruno collection contains all HTTP requests for the Flix Backend REST API.

  ## Base URL
  Select the `local` environment in Bruno to set `baseUrl` to `http://localhost:3000`.

  ## Authentication
  Protected routes (`/api/profile`, `/api/watch-history`, `/api/my-list`, and `/api/dislikes`) require an active Better Auth session.
  Execute `Auth / Sign In Email` or `Auth / Sign Up Email` first. Bruno automatically stores cookies for subsequent requests, or you can pass the `Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}` header if configured.
}

